<title>USA: San Mateo Cty, Calif., $81 mln won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>San Mateo Cty, Calif., $81 mln won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
